## Real Purchase Validation

Once real observations exist, verify the current purchase state machine against them.

Required checks:

```text
listing still matches
price still matches
item fingerprint still matches
correct confirmation GUI
correct confirmation control
inventory delta
balance/chat evidence
```

Any mismatch must abort.

## Real Sell Validation

Verify the real listing workflow:

```text
correct inventory item selected
correct quantity
correct price
correct GUI state
correct confirmation
listing visible afterwards
```

Do not consider a sell-listing successful until independently verified.

## Latency

Measure real timings:

```text
server/GUI event received
→ changed slot detected
→ listing parsed
→ opportunity decision
→ Redis lock
→ action dispatched
→ confirmation received
```

Report:

```text
p50
p95
p99
```

The internal benchmark is not enough; real client/server latency is now the important metric.

## Safety Modes

Support:

```text
OBSERVE_ONLY
ASSISTED
LIVE
PAUSED
```

`OBSERVE_ONLY`:
record only.

`ASSISTED`:
system proposes action, owner confirms.

`LIVE`:
existing guarded execution may act automatically.

Default new installations to `OBSERVE_ONLY`.

## Acceptance Criteria

Phase 4 is complete when:

1. Fabric bridge connects to backend locally.
2. Real DonutSMP GUI snapshots are captured.
3. Manual clicks are correlated with GUI transitions.
4. AH page structure is learned.
5. Purchase confirmation GUI is learned.
6. Selling flow is learned.
7. Real session replay works.
8. Existing parser/state machine passes against real captured fixtures.
9. Real latency metrics are recorded.
10. No unknown sensitive state is clicked automatically.
11. All existing tests still pass.

